  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mibanco: Senior Loan Supporting MSMEs Owned by and/or Led by Women in Peru</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project consists of a financing to Mibanco (&#x201c;Mibanco Per&#xfa;&#x201d;) composed by: (i) a senior unsecured renewable loan to be financed by IDB Invest for an amount of up to US$50 million equivalent in soles (&#x201c;PEN&#x201d;), which will promote the financial inclusion of Micro, Small, and Medium-Sized Enterprises (&#x201c;MSMEs&#x201d;) owned by and/or led by women and other vulnerable groups, and (ii) a parallel loan for an amount of up to US$50 million to be financed by a co-lender. The transaction will have a term of up to three years and bullet repayment.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project consists of a financing to Mibanco (&#x201c;Mibanco Per&#xfa;&#x201d;) composed by: (i) a senior unsecured renewable loan to be financed by IDB Invest for an amount of up to US$50 million equivalent in soles (&#x201c;PEN&#x201d;), which will promote the financial inclusion of Micro, Small, and Medium-Sized Enterprises (&#x201c;MSMEs&#x201d;) owned by and/or led by women and other vulnerable groups, and (ii) a parallel loan for an amount of up to US$50 million to be financed by a co-lender. The transaction will have a term of up to three years and bullet repayment.</narrative>
